    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kowechei Saul Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’alalji Saul Jonatan werinnyi, koboto otwogikyik tugul, kolenji kobar Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kibaibai mising’ Jonatan weritab Saul agobo Daudi. Ak kimwachi Jonatan Daudi, kolenji, Cheng’ei baba Saul kobarin: noto anyun asain mising’ ale, ripge karon, ak itebi eng’ ung’ot, iunyge: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si amanda ak awe atonone ye negite baba eng’ kewet eng’ ole imi, ak keng’alal ak baba agobo inye; ak ngot ageer kiy amwaun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’alalji Jonatan Saul kwandanyi, kochoi Daudi, kolenji, Amat koyachi tengek laitoriat otwogindennyi Daudi, amu ma yaun tengek, ak amu kagomiagitu mising’ boisionikyik che kogoyaun: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu ma iit sobondanyi, ak kogobar Pilistindet, ak kiyai Jehovah yetunet ne o agobo Israel tugul: kiigeer kioto aginye, ak kiibaibaitu: amu nee anyun si iyachi tengek korotik che matinyei tengek, ibar Daudi buch?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigas Saul ng’olyotab Jonatan: ak kiiyosio Saul kole, Ko u ye sobei Jehovah, ko magibarei inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiguur Jonatan Daudi ak koborji Jonatan inendet tuguchoto tugul. Ak kiimut Jonatan Daudi kwo ole mi Saul, ak kitebe tainnyi ko u eng’ tai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibiit luget kogeny: ak kimanda Daudi kwo kobargei ak Pilistik, ak kibar ichek eng’ baret ne o; ak kimwei eng’ tainnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinyonji Saul tamirmiriet ne ya ne kibunu Jehovah, ye kitebyei eng’ gonnyi, kotinyei ng’otit eng’ eunnyi; ak kibut Daudi kibugandet eng’ eunnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilen Saul kotoor Daudi eng’ ng’otit kosore inat; ago kichilil eng’ taitab Saul, ak kitoor inatut eng’ ng’otit: ak kimwei Daudi, ak kochilil kemounoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyokto Saul bik koba gotab Daudi, korib inendet kole si kobar inendet karon: ak kimwachi Mikal Daudi, osotiondennyi, kolenji, Ngot ko mesoru sobondang’ung’ kemouni, kebarin mutai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kochoorta anyun Mikal Daudi kwo ng’ony kobun tirisiet: ak kiwa komwei, kochilil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinam Mikal kanamwet, ak komogon eng’ itogut, ak kotichine met mutoit ne bo kororikab ng’ororek, ak kotuge ngoroik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingoyokto Saul bik koba konam Daudi, komwa kwondanyi kole, Miani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyokto Saul bichoto koba kogeer Daudi, kolenji, Omutwa eng’ itogut si anyo abar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingobwa go bichoto, ogeero, kimi kanamwet itok, komi metinnyi mutoinoto bo kororikab ng’ororek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Saul Mikal, Amu nee si igena ko u ni ak ichunde bunyondennyu kwo, kot ko kagochilil? Ak kiwolji Mikal Saul kolenji, Kilenja, Bagakta awa; kalya si imach abarin?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komwei anyun Daudi, ak kochilil, ak kwo ole mi Samuel eng’ Rama, kwo komwachi tuguk tugul che kiyachi inendet Saul. Kiba tuwai ak Samuel koba komeny Naiot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigimwachi Saul kelenji, Keero, mitei Daudi Naiot eng’ Rama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyokto Saul bik koba konam Daudi; ak kingogeer tuiyetab maotik komaotendos ng’alek, kotononi Samuel kondochin ichek, konyonji Tamirmirietab Kamuktaindet bikab Saul, ak komaotenso agichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingemwachi Saul ng’alechato, koyokto bik alak, ak kimaotenso agichek. Ak kiiyokto Saul bik, ne bo somok, ak kimaotenso agichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwa inendet agine Rama, ak kiit ole mi keringet ne o ne bo beek ne mitei Seku: ak kiteeb kole, Mi ano Samuel ak Daudi? Ak kile chito age, Keero, mi Naiot eng’ Rama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwa oloto bo Naiot eng’ Rama: ak kinyonji inendet agine Tamirmirietab Kamuktaindet, ak kiwa, komaotenot, kot koit Naiot eng’ Rama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiireek ngoroikyik, ak kimaoten agine eng’ taitab Samuel, ak koru ach ngor betunoto tugul ak kemounoto tugul. Noto anyun mwaei ichek kole, Bo Saul agine maotik?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
